    <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a> | <a href="/blog.html">Blog</a>
    </nav>
    <main>
        <!-- Page content -->
    </main>
</body>
</html>
```

This minimal HTML5 skeleton includes the doctype, html, head with title and stylesheet link, body with navigation to homepage and blog, per the requirements.
